{
  "identity": {
    "text": "Have you seen the weather forecast for our picnic by the lake? I am bringing the food, so I need to know where we will eat.\n\nThere is a dark cloud above the lake already. I think it is going to rain before noon. Should we cancel everything?\n\nGood idea. If it stays dry, we will meet under the large tree at eleven. If rain starts, we will move to the cafe beside the path.\n\nWhat about a storm? Last summer we heard thunder during a walk, and then we saw lightning. I do not want anyone to stay outside in that situation.\n\nThe lake looks very different in each season. In winter, fog sometimes hides the other side. I remember one cold, snowy visit when the ground was freezing.\n\nAgreed. The sunshine may return later, but we can enjoy lunch indoors too. I will send everyone the two meeting places by nine thirty.",
